  "Description": "Audio Scene Editing. One Scene is open at a time, so a User Command need not name it; opening is done by Port and creation opens implicitly. Objects arrive from CAE-AOE across the Topology - this AIM does not call that one. The listener's Point of View is set on the SCENE and not stamped on each entry, because an entity reused in a context keeps its own attributes unless the context provides them.",
